sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant NG as Nginx
    participant SEC as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant AUTH as AuthService
    participant DB as MySQL
    U->>SPA: email + password
    SPA->>NG: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    NG->>AUTH: proxied request
    AUTH->>DB: find user by email
    DB-->>AUTH: user (BCrypt hash, role, enabled)
    AUTH->>AUTH: verify password, account enabled
    AUTH-->>SPA: 200 accessToken (JWT HS256), expiresAt, user
    SPA->>SPA: store session, route by role (/app or /admin)
    Note over SPA,SEC: every later request
    SPA->>NG: GET /api/v1/learning/progress (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    NG->>SEC: proxied request
    SEC->>SEC: verify signature and expiry
    SEC->>DB: reload user (disabling or role changes apply instantly)
    SEC-->>SPA: 200 data, or 401 and the SPA signs out
